<title>GERMANY: Kirch signs film deal with PolyGram.</title>
<headline>Kirch signs film deal with PolyGram.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kirch Group said on Sunday it had signed an exclusive agreement with PolyGram Filmed Entertainment for television broadcast rights in the German-language market.</p>
<p>The 10-year agreement covers rights for pay-TV, pay-per-view, near-video-on-demand and video-on-demand for all films released by PolyGram in German theaters.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
